WEBVTT

00:05.480 --> 00:09.280
It's a story from long ago that
if we look at the full moon, we transform.

00:05.480 --> 00:10.820
DOGS AND RAINDROPS, PART 2

00:09.780 --> 00:14.110
But nowadays, werewolves transform
when we look at any crescent shape.

00:14.490 --> 00:15.870
A werewolf!

00:18.660 --> 00:21.580
We get stronger, more aggressive,

00:21.910 --> 00:24.170
and become a totally different person.

00:26.210 --> 00:28.460
Keigo is a werewolf!

00:30.630 --> 00:32.630
It was such a mystery to me.

00:32.630 --> 00:35.840
Why do I even have these powers?

00:35.840 --> 00:37.300
But that was such a dumb question.

00:37.800 --> 00:39.180
I have teeth, so I bite.

00:39.180 --> 00:40.760
I have claws, so I tear.

00:40.760 --> 00:42.430
I have strength, so I punch!

00:46.310 --> 00:48.520
Is that all you got?

00:48.730 --> 00:51.940
Werewolves are the most powerful after all!

00:57.280 --> 00:59.070
<i>Do not let your guard down.</i>

00:59.070 --> 01:03.750
<i>An ogre's best weapon is not
their strength, but their sturdiness.</i>

01:04.160 --> 01:07.210
I think this amount will be good for Kanshi.

01:15.880 --> 01:17.930
I can punch you, right?

01:21.810 --> 01:23.350
Did I fall asleep?

01:23.350 --> 01:26.060
That's right, the attack.
I need to let them know.

01:26.890 --> 01:30.270
THE DOGS ARE GATHERING AT KOJO PARK.
WE'RE GONNA HEAD THERE, TOO.

01:27.600 --> 01:31.480
From Nico?
They're all gathering at Kojo Park.

01:35.030 --> 01:36.150
KOJO PARK

01:37.490 --> 01:41.410
<i>So this is Alert?
It's such a terrible feeling.</i>

01:42.790 --> 01:44.910
<i>The warlock must be
somewhere in there.</i>

01:46.160 --> 01:48.420
Damn it, Morihito's not picking up.

01:46.160 --> 01:48.420
MORIHITO
CALLING

01:48.870 --> 01:51.880
Keigo's not around either,
so something definitely happened.

01:51.880 --> 01:55.840
Let's go! It's the Otogi house
on the second block!

01:57.720 --> 01:59.340
We're out of time.

01:59.340 --> 02:01.010
We'll take care of this ourselves.

02:01.760 --> 02:04.010
Do you feel disheartened
because Morihito isn't here?

02:05.980 --> 02:07.430
Yeah me, too.

02:07.940 --> 02:10.940
Before we realized it,
we'd become so dependent on him.

02:11.230 --> 02:12.690
It's kind of pathetic, huh?

02:12.900 --> 02:18.240
I'm worried about your injury.
Plus, I mess up all the time, too.

02:20.490 --> 02:23.450
A wounded tengu
and a klutzy witch combo, huh?

02:23.660 --> 02:25.950
Yeah. But we have to do it.

02:26.580 --> 02:28.910
We're full of weaknesses,
but no matter how small our power,

02:28.910 --> 02:31.460
if we combine our strength,
it'll get things done.

02:31.460 --> 02:34.040
That's what Sgt. Punch at Hyoutan Park said!

02:34.040 --> 02:36.210
What would that mysterious old man know?

02:37.420 --> 02:39.300
Mobliviate!

02:39.430 --> 02:40.470
<i>Mobliviate.</i>

02:41.140 --> 02:45.390
<i>While holding a certain pose, this spell
will allow your presence to be erased.</i>

02:45.600 --> 02:49.730
<i>Additionally, two people under the same spell
can interact with each other.</i>

02:52.480 --> 02:56.110
Our priority is to find the warlock
and neutralize them, right?

02:56.400 --> 02:58.690
Do you know where they are
with the Alert spell?

02:58.690 --> 03:02.360
Y-Yeah, I think if I get really close,
I can tell.

03:02.360 --> 03:04.990
All right, then the plan is simple.

03:05.450 --> 03:08.330
Nico, you'll find the warlock
with the Alert's response,

03:08.330 --> 03:10.410
and once we find them, I'll attack.

03:11.420 --> 03:14.250
While moving about, be careful
not to touch or bump into anyone.

03:14.630 --> 03:16.130
Okay, it's perfect.

03:16.130 --> 03:17.050
Here we go.

03:17.050 --> 03:18.880
Kan and Nico Channel, move out!

03:19.170 --> 03:20.010
Whoa!

03:21.260 --> 03:22.510
Way too hard!

03:23.180 --> 03:28.020
The wolf's battle has begun.
So that means, in this location...

03:28.350 --> 03:31.520
Listen up, Dogs!
There's a rat in our midst!

03:35.400 --> 03:37.610
Whoa! Wh-What the heck?

03:37.980 --> 03:41.110
These guys suddenly
started swinging! Nico, get away!

03:41.110 --> 03:41.860
Okay!

03:44.280 --> 03:46.530
Doesn't even matter
if you're friend or foe, huh?

03:46.530 --> 03:48.700
Did they find out that I cast a spell?

03:48.700 --> 03:50.250
Looks like it.

03:50.750 --> 03:51.960
Guess it can't be helped.

03:51.960 --> 03:54.040
I'll drop the spell and charge in.

03:54.040 --> 03:55.840
If I could use both hands,
50 people should be...

03:55.840 --> 03:57.130
Wait, Kan!

03:57.500 --> 03:59.510
I actually thought of a strategy.

04:02.340 --> 04:04.010
But that's way too dangerous.

04:04.430 --> 04:07.010
Let's do it. Because...

04:07.560 --> 04:09.560
I'm not here just to be protected!

04:17.230 --> 04:20.860
<i>Just fly as close as I can, and go in the direction
where the reaction is strongest.</i>

04:23.110 --> 04:26.030
I found you! That's definitely
a suspicious looking person!

04:26.490 --> 04:30.830
Kan, at ten o'clock. The afro
wearing the jinbei and shawl!

04:30.830 --> 04:32.330
What's wrong with them?

04:32.620 --> 04:37.920
Oho, you expose yourself, but the tengu
who's still invisible is coming for me, eh?

04:37.920 --> 04:40.500
But I will expose him as well!

04:41.800 --> 04:42.920
What?

04:42.920 --> 04:43.920
Enchantment magic!

04:43.920 --> 04:46.510
They put magic power
in the shawl and are controlling it.

04:47.010 --> 04:47.930
Ouch.

04:47.930 --> 04:50.390
There he is. Dogs, get him!

04:51.680 --> 04:52.770
Yeouch!

04:54.270 --> 04:57.230
Tie his arms! They're done for now.

04:58.110 --> 04:59.900
Yeah, for you!

05:00.190 --> 05:01.360
Division magic?

05:01.360 --> 05:02.650
Yay!

05:02.820 --> 05:04.150
There!

05:04.450 --> 05:05.650
Mobliviate.

05:05.910 --> 05:06.910
My cloak!

05:07.160 --> 05:08.160
Doublit!

05:08.410 --> 05:09.740
We're full of weaknesses...

05:09.740 --> 05:11.490
...but no matter how small our power,

05:12.120 --> 05:14.410
...if we combine our strength,
it'll get things done.

05:14.410 --> 05:16.670
The words of Sgt. Punch!

05:17.830 --> 05:21.090
Huh? This person isn't the warlock.

05:21.090 --> 05:23.210
What? Then it's someone else?

05:23.210 --> 05:25.470
No, it's definitely this person.

05:25.470 --> 05:26.510
Then this is the warlock.

05:26.510 --> 05:28.300
No, but it's not.

05:28.300 --> 05:30.140
What the hell are you saying?

05:33.220 --> 05:36.270
Wait, is this the Enchanter?

05:36.520 --> 05:37.650
So small!

05:37.900 --> 05:41.820
What, are you being serious?

05:42.400 --> 05:44.150
ENCHANTER
DEFEATED

05:44.440 --> 05:47.660
T-To be defeated like this...

05:47.950 --> 05:51.120
I... I...

05:51.990 --> 05:55.040
I have witch blood flowing within me.

05:55.330 --> 05:58.710
I knew I was a chosen being after all.

06:03.920 --> 06:06.880
Now, I can finally become happy.

06:11.010 --> 06:14.270
Why? I even became a warlock.

06:14.270 --> 06:18.560
So why is my life
far from becoming happy?

06:21.480 --> 06:24.440
I can awaken your dormant powers.

06:25.400 --> 06:26.860
My powers?

06:26.860 --> 06:28.570
You'll have to give up something,

06:28.950 --> 06:33.120
but you'll be granted a true witch's power,
and your lifespan will also increase.

06:34.830 --> 06:39.830
I don't know who you are, but please do it.
I don't want to die here.

06:40.170 --> 06:45.460
And so, in order to obtain a true witch's power,
I had to pay a price.

06:45.750 --> 06:47.170
And that's why I'm so small.

06:47.170 --> 06:48.840
That's way too big of a price.

06:49.090 --> 06:51.840
No, no. You have to think about
the risks and returns.

06:51.840 --> 06:55.100
Yeah, you should really ask questions
and look at the fine print on the contract.

06:55.350 --> 06:57.350
Now you look just like a bagworm.

06:57.350 --> 06:58.850
Silence, all of you.

06:58.980 --> 07:03.980
I was supposed to return to a normal size
when this plan succeeded.

07:04.230 --> 07:05.730
Yeah, that's right.

07:05.730 --> 07:08.610
What's this plan
that's supposed to capture Nico?

07:08.940 --> 07:12.570
Looks like you're just a collaborator,
so who's the mastermind?

07:14.120 --> 07:17.500
I'm not so much of a good person
that I'll tell you that—

07:17.950 --> 07:20.040
I mean, do you understand
the position you're in?

07:19.330 --> 07:20.750
Ouch! Ow, you demon!

07:20.040 --> 07:22.250
Nico! Kanshi!

07:22.250 --> 07:24.040
Nemu, you came for us.

07:24.040 --> 07:25.250
Where're the Dogs?

07:25.250 --> 07:28.090
The spell's effect wore off,
so they all dispersed.

07:27.000 --> 07:28.630
What was I doing?

07:29.130 --> 07:31.470
And that bagworm lady
is the Enchanter, I assume?

07:31.470 --> 07:32.380
Shut it.

07:32.720 --> 07:34.720
You knew about her size?

07:34.720 --> 07:39.270
Yes, I found out her secret and wanted
to tell you, but she put me to sleep.

07:39.640 --> 07:42.190
But I'm glad everyone's okay.

07:42.650 --> 07:44.400
Oh, where's Morihito?

07:44.690 --> 07:49.400
He disappeared on our way here,
along with our friend, Keigo.

07:49.780 --> 07:51.070
I see.

07:51.070 --> 07:55.530
So this Keigo, the werewolf,
is your familiar, right?

07:56.030 --> 07:57.280
Keigo is a familiar?

07:57.280 --> 07:58.370
A werewolf?

07:58.830 --> 08:01.830
I think Keigo and Wolf are the same person.

08:01.830 --> 08:04.380
And he should be fighting
with Morihito right now.

08:04.630 --> 08:07.590
You will take us there now, Enchanter.

08:20.390 --> 08:21.680
<i>The force from his punches.</i>

08:21.890 --> 08:23.310
<i>The slashing from his claws.</i>

08:23.480 --> 08:25.310
<i>His movement like a wild animal's...</i>

08:25.860 --> 08:28.270
<i>It's like he was born only to fight.</i>

08:29.280 --> 08:30.900
A werewolf, huh?

08:31.280 --> 08:33.200
I thought that lineage had died out.

08:33.360 --> 08:35.740
Apparently it's from my dead dad's side.

08:35.740 --> 08:39.700
Even though he didn't have any powers.
It's like reversion, isn't it?

08:40.290 --> 08:42.370
It manifested about three years ago.

08:42.790 --> 08:46.130
You're a different personality, but it
looks like you retain his memories.

08:46.880 --> 08:49.880
What's the mental connection between you
and your self before the transformation?

08:49.880 --> 08:54.970
I retain Keigo's memories,
but Keigo doesn't get mine.

08:55.470 --> 08:58.430
The one who made the pact
with the witch was Keigo,

08:58.600 --> 09:02.310
and any work relating to the pact
was my responsibility.

09:02.470 --> 09:07.480
MEMO
GET CLOSE TO MORIHITO OTOGI.

09:02.890 --> 09:04.310
If I needed to talk to Keigo,

09:04.310 --> 09:07.480
then I'd leave a note on his smartphone
ordering him to do something.

09:07.480 --> 09:09.320
Something like get close to them,

09:07.480 --> 09:12.030
MEMO
GET CLOSE TO MORIHITO OTOGI.
GET THEM TO TRUST YOU AND GET INFORMATION
ABOUT THE WITCH AND HER BODYGUARDS

09:09.320 --> 09:12.030
and get information about the witch
and her bodyguards.

09:12.780 --> 09:15.990
So that's why you talked to me so much.

09:17.030 --> 09:19.740
You said you retain
Keigo's memories, right?

09:20.120 --> 09:21.540
Then let me ask you something.

09:22.370 --> 09:25.500
When you were tricking me,
what was going through your head?

09:28.170 --> 09:29.750
Were you laughing on the inside?

09:30.790 --> 09:32.000
I wonder.

09:32.670 --> 09:34.300
I'm not that friendly,

09:34.300 --> 09:37.090
and Nico tells me that
I don't have interest in people,

09:37.090 --> 09:38.890
so it's hard for people to approach me.

09:39.050 --> 09:42.810
And it's true.
I don't really try to make friends.

09:43.270 --> 09:45.390
So I was actually really happy...

09:46.230 --> 09:47.650
that we became friends.

09:47.650 --> 09:48.520
Shut up!

09:48.850 --> 09:50.650
And then, that time...

09:51.150 --> 09:53.900
<i>...y-you're my friends.</i>

09:54.860 --> 09:57.150
You had tears in your eyes!

09:57.150 --> 09:59.030
I don't know what you're talking about!

10:02.660 --> 10:06.160
You already know, don't you?
I won't lose in a one-on-one fight.

10:06.160 --> 10:09.500
So you think you won
when you succeeded in splitting us up?

10:09.500 --> 10:12.420
The wolf from children's stories
was more cunning.

10:12.590 --> 10:15.050
You're saying that while you're all beat up.

10:15.050 --> 10:17.720
Now, it's over!

10:24.430 --> 10:27.770
Slime Lotion Gel Amoebas!

10:28.980 --> 10:32.360
Looks like you didn't predict
that your witch would be defeated.

10:32.480 --> 10:35.360
Ogre Qigong Fighting Style,
Lightning Burst!

10:41.370 --> 10:43.080
We're even in a one-on-one match.

10:43.410 --> 10:44.370
But...

10:45.910 --> 10:47.750
I have my friends with me.

10:48.660 --> 10:50.000
Now, it's over.

10:51.040 --> 10:52.330
Damn it.

10:54.800 --> 10:55.590
Nico!

10:55.590 --> 10:59.720
I'm sorry, Moi.
I think I used up all my magic power.

11:00.050 --> 11:00.800
What?

11:01.930 --> 11:05.720
Now we both don't have our witch's support.

11:06.810 --> 11:09.730
You weren't using
magic power from the candy?

11:10.190 --> 11:12.350
Like I would dope myself up like that.

11:13.110 --> 11:15.110
Let's finish this already.

11:15.320 --> 11:20.950
Keigo, stop! Your plan failed.
You don't have to fight anymore!

11:22.620 --> 11:25.620
Listen, Wolf. Hurry and kill that ogre.

11:25.620 --> 11:28.370
If we kill them all,
we'll have turned the tables!

11:28.620 --> 11:31.120
What's with the tough act
all of a sudden, huh?

11:31.120 --> 11:33.380
I'll put you in a capsule
and use you as a golf ball.

11:33.380 --> 11:35.670
Or maybe I could dunk you
in some extra carbonated water?

11:35.670 --> 11:37.550
You life is in my grasp, you hear me?

11:37.550 --> 11:40.130
Oh yeah, go ahead and kill her.

11:40.130 --> 11:41.760
I'll die too, though.

11:43.090 --> 11:44.510
A familiar's pact.

11:44.930 --> 11:47.600
The life of the bodyguard
is bound to who they're protecting.

11:47.850 --> 11:50.680
You guys don't have an official pact
with the Witch of Thousands,

11:50.680 --> 11:53.100
but this is what the sign
for a real one looks like.

11:53.100 --> 11:54.810
O-Oh, no...

11:55.060 --> 11:58.940
That's the way of it.
You can't kill your friend, right?

11:58.940 --> 12:02.950
And behold
how he innocently wants to fight you.

12:08.160 --> 12:12.830
Fighting is a werewolf's innate desire.

12:13.040 --> 12:14.210
They're even.

12:14.210 --> 12:17.340
No, Keigo has the upper hand.

12:19.840 --> 12:21.840
<i>I've been continuing
my Ogre Qigong training.</i>

12:22.630 --> 12:26.640
<i>After practicing with Kanshi,
I've increased my attack patterns.</i>

12:27.640 --> 12:32.350
<i>But it's hard to predict where he'll
attack from, and how I should dodge it.</i>

12:33.020 --> 12:34.940
<i>His movement doesn't have a form.</i>

12:38.980 --> 12:40.150
Moi!

12:40.150 --> 12:43.570
His fighting style focuses on hitting vital points,
so its attacks are easy to read.

12:43.820 --> 12:47.410
Morihito's attacks
are too proper and precise.

12:48.030 --> 12:50.830
I've already adapted
to your cool-headed fists.

12:51.080 --> 12:53.540
Admit your defeat, Morihito Otogi!

12:53.540 --> 12:57.080
And say that you lost
to a werewolf's fighting spirit.

12:57.080 --> 13:01.380
I see. So the more hot-headed you get
in battle, the stronger you become.

13:02.720 --> 13:04.590
This isn't a manga, you know.

13:06.300 --> 13:10.010
<i>Nico, it'll be okay. Don't worry.</i>

13:10.810 --> 13:12.600
<i>I'm always calm and collected.</i>

13:13.640 --> 13:16.480
<i>I won't get all hot and bothered
just because I got bit by a dog.</i>

13:17.150 --> 13:21.440
<i>Ogre Qigong Fighting Style,
Dancing Lanterns!</i>

13:24.570 --> 13:29.120
<i>Don't get hot. Calm down,
and aim with pinpoint accuracy.</i>

13:30.330 --> 13:33.500
You're only making scratches!

13:33.620 --> 13:35.370
Upper left, bottom right...

13:35.370 --> 13:36.830
Step back, then left.

13:37.330 --> 13:38.880
Then block with the right hand.

13:39.420 --> 13:42.130
Crouch, and then jump to the left.

13:43.210 --> 13:45.260
I see what Morihito's doing.

13:45.510 --> 13:49.930
He's controlling the way Keigo dodges
by using his continuous and precise attacks.

13:51.600 --> 13:55.600
And is that how you're trying
to drag me to the slippery surface?

13:55.890 --> 13:57.390
I know what you're doing!

13:57.900 --> 14:00.810
Yes, and that's why you dodge to the left.

14:00.810 --> 14:03.030
And that's where
you'll get grazed for the fourth time.

14:06.570 --> 14:07.570
From that time...

14:07.950 --> 14:09.030
I told you.

14:09.660 --> 14:10.570
That I have...

14:11.660 --> 14:14.040
<i>Slime Lotion Gel Amoebas!</i>

14:14.040 --> 14:16.790
<i>I need to get you at least once
or else I won't be satisfied.</i>

14:16.790 --> 14:18.540
I have my friends with me!

14:18.960 --> 14:22.000
Get him, Morihito!

14:22.920 --> 14:26.550
Ogre Qigong Fighting Style,
Death's Wail!

14:32.260 --> 14:34.350
Maybe I got a little too hot there.

14:37.480 --> 14:38.440
You did it!

14:38.440 --> 14:39.810
Morihito!

14:39.810 --> 14:40.810
Moi!

14:41.150 --> 14:43.650
Moi. Moi!

14:44.400 --> 14:48.070
<i>Oh, crap. If I keep going,
I'll end up hugging him.</i>

14:48.320 --> 14:51.320
<i>This is so embarrassing. Stop, stop!</i>

14:56.160 --> 14:58.330
M-Moi?

14:58.580 --> 15:00.920
Nico, are you hurt?

15:01.290 --> 15:04.210
I'm sorry,
I said I'd protect you and yet...

15:05.420 --> 15:06.340
Don't worry.

15:06.710 --> 15:10.380
Kan protected me, even when he was injured.

15:10.630 --> 15:14.850
And you fought so hard
and got all beat up, too.

15:15.470 --> 15:17.980
Thank you, really.

15:21.190 --> 15:24.230
Hug me too, Morihito.

15:25.900 --> 15:28.490
<i>Human-type familiars are the best.</i>

15:30.200 --> 15:32.360
Sorry, I got carried away.

15:36.660 --> 15:38.450
I got a little too hot-headed.

15:40.960 --> 15:44.000
Enchanter, the battle is over.

15:44.380 --> 15:46.340
Release Keigo from his pact.

15:46.920 --> 15:50.420
If I dissolve his pact,
then you'll kill me.

15:50.420 --> 15:51.970
The werewolf is my hostage.

15:52.220 --> 15:57.720
Ms. Enchanter, we won't do anything
to hurt you, because we're both witches.

15:58.350 --> 16:01.770
I don't really understand
witches and warlocks.

16:01.770 --> 16:06.860
But I can ask my mother if there's a peaceful way
for you to live in the witches' village.

16:06.860 --> 16:11.950
I just think it'll be wonderful if us witches
could all get along and talk to each other.

16:11.950 --> 16:15.870
Maybe talk about things like when we mess up
a spell, or how bad we failed at something.

16:15.870 --> 16:17.490
Why is everyone there a klutz?

16:17.830 --> 16:21.040
I think witches also have
their own problems as well.

16:21.040 --> 16:23.330
We should share and come
to understand each other.

16:23.710 --> 16:29.880
So please, can you tell me
about this plan that involves capturing me?

16:32.840 --> 16:35.260
You cheeky little girl...

16:35.850 --> 16:38.390
The mastermind behind the plan is...

16:41.140 --> 16:43.520
The mastermind's name is...

16:45.190 --> 16:47.110
What? What's happening?

16:52.740 --> 16:53.900
Her body is...

16:53.900 --> 16:55.410
...returning to normal size?

16:57.370 --> 16:59.790
I want to tell you...

17:00.290 --> 17:02.450
The... seal...

17:09.040 --> 17:10.670
<i>Her magic power was stolen?</i>

17:11.210 --> 17:15.430
<i>Is this a spell that activates when
information is about to get leaked?</i>

17:16.890 --> 17:17.890
Keigo!

17:20.390 --> 17:21.680
I'm alive.

17:21.890 --> 17:22.730
Keigo!

17:22.810 --> 17:23.680
Keigo!

17:23.930 --> 17:25.940
The sign of the pact is gone.

17:26.150 --> 17:29.520
When her magic power got stolen,
it must've negated the pact.

17:29.900 --> 17:30.820
Ouch.

17:30.940 --> 17:32.190
Keigo!

17:33.150 --> 17:34.200
Are you all right?

17:34.450 --> 17:37.200
That damage must be rough for your body.

17:37.200 --> 17:40.660
My magic power restored a little,
so I'll cast some healing...

17:40.660 --> 17:44.080
No, don't. Please don't do that.

17:44.410 --> 17:46.790
I did something unforgiveable.

17:48.290 --> 17:50.340
Yes, I won't forgive you.

17:51.250 --> 17:53.210
Until you tell me everything.

17:55.800 --> 17:58.090
This space will soon disappear.

17:58.430 --> 18:00.220
Let's go outside and talk.

18:03.350 --> 18:06.480
Okay now, start talking.

18:06.480 --> 18:09.980
In a bathhouse?
And not at some bench or something?

18:10.190 --> 18:12.020
The rules say that
after guys fight each other,

18:12.020 --> 18:15.150
we're supposed to wash
each other's backs in a bathhouse.

18:15.150 --> 18:18.950
There's no such rule. What kind of old-timey
adolescent drama is that from?

18:19.160 --> 18:22.160
I can't handle those kinds
of macho thoughts.

18:22.160 --> 18:23.790
Right, Morihito?

18:24.910 --> 18:27.290
I found heaven right near my house.

18:27.290 --> 18:28.870
He's getting healed the most.

18:28.870 --> 18:32.130
When he becomes an old man,
I feel like he'll really get into saunas.

18:32.590 --> 18:36.630
Well, I think it's a good idea
to wash away the dirt and grudges.

18:37.260 --> 18:41.390
You guys aren't mad? I deceived all of you.

18:41.680 --> 18:42.850
- Yeah, I'm mad.
- I'm pissed!

18:42.850 --> 18:44.270
You were mad.

18:44.270 --> 18:45.680
Let's hear it.

18:45.680 --> 18:48.770
Your goal was to fix the wound
left from that accident, right?

18:50.060 --> 18:52.520
Yeah, that's right.

18:52.900 --> 18:55.360
Scrub, scrub, scrub!

18:55.360 --> 18:57.650
<i>And now, I have another bubble dress
once again.</i>

18:57.950 --> 19:01.820
I've always wanted to be
in a scrub-off like this with a friend.

19:02.620 --> 19:05.490
The Enchanter doesn't have
a cure-all medicine?

19:05.830 --> 19:08.870
It's a custom, so I'm sure you have one,

19:08.870 --> 19:12.840
but that medicine is made from a witch's
umbilical cord when they're born.

19:12.840 --> 19:13.880
I see.

19:14.170 --> 19:18.380
So the Enchanter who wasn't born
as a witch probably doesn't have one.

19:18.670 --> 19:21.470
So she was lying to Keigo?

19:22.430 --> 19:24.680
I'm sorry this had to happen to him.

19:25.850 --> 19:28.600
So, I've been thinking about something.

19:29.690 --> 19:34.270
I think I'd like to have Keigo
use my medicine.

19:34.480 --> 19:38.780
What? But for you, there'll most likely be
a situation where you'll need it.

19:39.570 --> 19:43.780
Even after defeating the Enchanter,
the sigil on that paper didn't disappear.

19:44.120 --> 19:46.620
The dire prophecy
is still active and continuing.

19:46.620 --> 19:49.500
Yeah, but I think it'll be okay.

19:50.460 --> 19:53.290
Because Moi and the others are strong.

19:56.380 --> 19:58.630
You sound quite confident there.

20:02.090 --> 20:04.600
MAGAMI

20:02.380 --> 20:05.010
Mom, I brought my friends over.

20:05.010 --> 20:06.430
Thank you for having us!

20:06.430 --> 20:07.640
- Hey there.
- Thank you.

20:07.640 --> 20:08.850
Welcome!

20:09.230 --> 20:12.730
I'm so glad that Keigo
invited his friends over.

20:15.110 --> 20:17.320
So that's what this is about.

20:19.110 --> 20:20.690
Did you know about this, Nico?

20:20.950 --> 20:26.990
I had a feeling that Keigo wouldn't
make a pact for his own greed.

20:27.410 --> 20:32.500
If it's my goal to use magic for other people,
then I want to help them.

20:34.710 --> 20:38.420
This is my friend, who's a witch,
and then an ogre and tengu.

20:38.420 --> 20:40.010
What kind of introduction is that?

20:40.550 --> 20:45.090
I won't be surprised by that now.
My son is a werewolf, after all.

20:45.090 --> 20:48.510
I guess having a monster in the family
makes it easier to accept this stuff.

20:48.850 --> 20:52.770
My injury is already healed,
and it doesn't affect me anymore.

20:52.980 --> 20:54.770
The reason I quit figure skating

20:54.900 --> 20:59.480
is because if there's a chance the werewolf's
powers could affect my body,

20:59.480 --> 21:02.030
then I thought it would be unfair
as a competitor.

21:02.400 --> 21:06.240
Besides, I'd been thinking about
quitting for a while already,

21:06.240 --> 21:07.660
and then the accident happened.

21:08.620 --> 21:10.950
My wish is for my mother.

21:11.700 --> 21:14.710
Because she drove me to the venue, she...

21:15.250 --> 21:20.090
Please don't think like that.
I said I'm doing fine.

21:21.130 --> 21:23.010
Here you go, Keigo.

21:26.890 --> 21:29.560
Mom, this is a magical medicine.

21:58.460 --> 21:59.590
Thank you.

22:00.340 --> 22:02.800
Nico... Thank you.

22:03.300 --> 22:07.590
I'm sorry.
I'm so sorry for deceiving you.

22:07.800 --> 22:10.100
Oh, I'm so glad.

22:10.100 --> 22:11.680
I'm so...

22:12.970 --> 22:16.350
I'm so happy for you.

22:20.310 --> 22:25.110
<i>That day, Keigo's mom made
a delicious feast for everyone,</i>

22:25.110 --> 22:27.360
<i>and we all got rowdy and it was so fun.</i>

22:27.610 --> 22:30.370
<i>Moi was in a great mood
the whole time, too.</i>

22:30.620 --> 22:33.370
We'll have to start repaying this kindness.

22:33.370 --> 22:36.250
It's fine, I'm happy with just this gratin.

22:36.410 --> 22:39.630
Keigo's the one who did it,
so he should repay it.

22:39.630 --> 22:41.250
What? How?

22:41.250 --> 22:43.710
Something like buying me a juice box
everyday during lunch time.

22:43.710 --> 22:44.760
I'm just your gofer.

22:44.760 --> 22:46.510
Perfect for a puppy.

22:46.510 --> 22:47.720
I'm a wolf!

22:47.720 --> 22:49.760
Then please, use him as you wish.

22:55.890 --> 22:56.930
You're moving in?

22:57.230 --> 23:00.230
The thing is, since Mom's leg got healed,

23:00.230 --> 23:03.770
she restarted an overseas work project
that she had given up on.

23:03.770 --> 23:07.440
So, instead of being by myself, she'd feel
much better if I was with you guys.

23:07.780 --> 23:09.990
So she went and talked
to Morihito about it.

23:09.990 --> 23:13.700
If he becomes Nico's bodyguard,
then I have no reason to oppose.

23:14.030 --> 23:16.870
If there's any way I can help,
then I want to repay your kindness.

23:17.160 --> 23:18.580
If you're okay with it.

23:25.300 --> 23:28.840
Of course I'm definitely okay with it!

23:29.300 --> 23:32.050
Am I allowed to put
pushpin holes in the walls?

23:32.050 --> 23:34.600
I tend to immediately
buy postcards that I like.

23:35.060 --> 23:37.020
Also, what's the internet situation here?

23:37.020 --> 23:38.730
I prefer to be directly plugged in
instead of using Wi-Fi.

23:38.730 --> 23:40.600
Gosh, he's noisy.

23:40.980 --> 23:44.020
Oh yeah, sorry
if my subwoofer gets too loud.

23:44.020 --> 23:45.730
You should keep that down!

23:45.860 --> 23:47.110
What the hell is this?

23:47.110 --> 23:50.490
There's a witch, an ogre, and a werewolf.
What kind of haunted house is this?

23:50.490 --> 23:51.740
You're one to talk, you tengu.

23:51.740 --> 23:55.200
Yeah, I'm a tengu!
Tengu are saviors of justice!

23:51.740 --> 23:55.740
<i>And so, Keigo Magami
has joined the Otogi household!</i>

23:58.290 --> 23:59.710
Keigo has moved in!

23:59.710 --> 24:00.660
Congratulations!

24:00.660 --> 24:02.250
Oh, I'm Keigo Magami.

24:02.250 --> 24:05.670
I've always had my eye on the ending song's
aooo, and I'm a big fan of "Red Park."

24:05.670 --> 24:06.590
Enough of that already.

24:06.590 --> 24:08.170
With this episode,
we've finished the first cour,

24:06.840 --> 24:12.010
NEXT EPISODE
KEIGO MAGAMI, THE WEREWOLF
KIND TIGER, PROUD WOLF
EASY SPICES
FOR ENTHRALLING COOKING

24:08.170 --> 24:10.550
but we're continuing
to the second cour next week.

24:10.550 --> 24:12.010
Enough of that, too.
